Retro76 — Tibia 7.6

RULES
  General · Reference penalties; staff adjust them by severity (warning → 3-7 days → permanent)
  Bots · No cavebot, healbot, aimbot, modified client or auto-loot
  Bots · Macros only for training and runemaking; not for hunting, PvP or looting
  Bots · Benefiting from someone else's cheat is also punished
  MC · At most 4 characters online per person
  MC · Not allowed in combat: hunting, PvP, wars, healing, MW, spawn blocking or harassing players
  MC · Caught in combat: ban on the highest-level character
  MC · Passive use is OK: runes in the depot or scouting without joining fights
  Abuse · Don't abuse or hide bugs; RMT and account selling = ban
  Abuse · No giving away exp, rookgaard hunting, or alts blocking spawns or wars
  PvP · Hunting players is normal; it doesn't count as griefing
  PvP · It is griefing to block NPCs/spawns or disrupt wars with low-level characters
  Account · Offensive names or names imitating a GM → rename or ban
  Account · Serious insults, spam and advertising other OTs → punished
  Reports · Tell the staff in game if you see bots, MC or abuse

RATES
  Exp per level: 9-40 x5 | 41-70 x4 | 71-100 x2 | 101+ x1  |  Loot x3  |  Skills x4  |  ML x3  |  Food regen x5

PREMIUM
  Voluntary donation to support the server
  Includes premium time with classic 7.6 perks
  +10% exp and +10% monster loot  |  Skills and ML x2 (on top of the global rates)
  Faster health/mana regeneration  |  6 h/day of training (free: 2 h)
  Classic 7.6 premium outfits (citizen, hunter, mage, knight)
  Promotion with Orlan: level 20 and 20k gp (free or premium). Premium improves regeneration further
  Suggested amounts: 1 week $4,000  |  2 weeks $6,000 (CLP)

DEATH
  -7% exp, ML, skills and equipment  |  -100% backpack

PVP
  PvP world with skulls  |  PZ lock 10 sec  |  !pz
  Personal yellow skull: if a player hits you, you see them yellow for 1 min and killing them in that window gives no frag
  White skull: 1 min when attacking  |  15 min when killing
  3 frags = red skull (6 h)  |  10 frags = ban
  1 frag every 5 h  |  !frags
  Killing a player: you get 50% of the exp they lost (based on your damage)

COMBAT
  Runes/spells: 2 sec exhaust  |  Healing: 1 sec
  Arrows/bolts are used up  |  Spears and stones are not

CAP / RUNES
  Capacity enabled  |  Base 300 (level <=10) + capgain per level  |  Recalculated at login
  Rune weight: standard Tibia 7.6 (oz per charge)

CUSTOM
  Trainer Monk (training room 133-160, 7-18)
  Training: 2 h/day (premium 6 h), red warning when entering and at 5 min, white counter at the bottom
  Angry Troll (when killing a Troll)
  exori gran (Knight)  |  exevo vis lux Energy Beam (Sorcerer ML 10)
  exevo pan (Create Food, all vocations, 30 mana)
  Magic Wall: use the rune at ML 9 | conjure (adevo grav tera) at ML 14, all vocations
  Soft Boots (3549): +3 HP and +12 MP every 3 s, 4 h of use; when used up → worn (3550)
  Perac: arrows (50=100 gp), bolts (50=150 gp), power bolts (50=400 gp)
  Seller: mana/life fluid, rope, shovel, backpack
  Parived: buys gems and diamonds (say gems)
  Tonka (1 floor above Parived): 20 small → 1 big (say exchange)
  Golden ring (2179) in the ring slot: +20% gold from monsters
  Golden amulet (2130) equipped: loot gold goes straight to the bank when you kill (no need to open the corpse)
  Ring + amulet: the ring adds its bonus first and the amulet deposits that total in the bank
  Imbuements (Use a gem on an equipped item; the imbue stays on the item if you lose it):
    Yellow gem → boots: +10 haste each, max 3 (stacks with BOH)
    Violet gem → wand/rod: +1 ML each, max 4 (wand damage and shown ML)
    Big ruby → weapon: +5% / +9% / +16% attack speed, max 3 (nightglass: 5 stacks)
    Big emerald → armor: +1 sword/club/axe/dist each, max 4 (demon armor 6) (P/K)
    Blue gem → crystal arrow: +5% attack speed each, max 5
  Levitate: `exani hur "up"` / `exani hur "down"`

OTHER
  Autosave 10 min  |  Free spells  |  Party/Guilds
